        <ul class="timeline">
          <li data-aos="fade-right">
            <div class="timeline-image"><picture><source srcset="/assets/img/about/about-building.webp" type="image/webp" /><img class="rounded-circle img-fluid" src="/assets/img/about/about-building.jpg" alt="DGSDK company headquarters building" loading="lazy" /></picture></div>
            <div class="timeline-panel">
              <div class="timeline-heading"><h4>Founded in 2013</h4><h4 class="subheading">Professional Industrial Manufacturer</h4></div>
              <div class="timeline-body"><p class="text-muted">DGSDK was established in Dongguan and developed industrial static control equipment for manufacturers serving global markets.</p></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-inverted" data-aos="fade-left">
            <div class="timeline-image"><picture><source srcset="/assets/img/about/about-workshop-3.webp" type="image/webp" /><img class="rounded-circle img-fluid" src="/assets/img/about/about-workshop-3.jpg" alt="DGSDK technicians assembling cleaning machines" loading="lazy" /></picture></div>
            <div class="timeline-panel">
              <div class="timeline-heading"><h4>Technology Expansion</h4><h4 class="subheading">Static Control & Cleaning Solutions</h4></div>
              <div class="timeline-body"><p class="text-muted">We expanded our product range to include static eliminators and industrial cleaning machines for electronics, SMT, and optical film industries.</p></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li data-aos="fade-right">
            <div class="timeline-image"><picture><source srcset="/assets/img/about/about-workshop-1.webp" type="image/webp" /><img class="rounded-circle img-fluid" src="/assets/img/about/about-workshop-1.jpg" alt="DGSDK factory production floor" loading="lazy" /></picture></div>
            <div class="timeline-panel">
              <div class="timeline-heading"><h4>Focused Product Strategy</h4><h4 class="subheading">Static Control First, Cleaning Second</h4></div>
              <div class="timeline-body"><p class="text-muted">Our product strategy now centers on ionizing bars and industrial static eliminators, followed by surface cleaning machines and line-integration support.</p></div>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="timeline-inverted" data-aos="fade-left">
            <div class="timeline-image"><picture><source srcset="/assets/img/about/about-lobby.webp" type="image/webp" /><img class="rounded-circle img-fluid" src="/assets/img/about/about-lobby.jpg" alt="DGSDK company lobby" loading="lazy" /></picture></div>
            <div class="timeline-panel">
              <div class="timeline-heading"><h4>Global Service</h4><h4 class="subheading">Long-Term Industrial Cooperation</h4></div>
              <div class="timeline-body"><p class="text-muted">DGSDK serves global customers with stable quality, engineering support, and practical industrial solutions for long-term cooperation.</p></div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
